My personal dotfiles

Installation
============

To use:
* Clone to ~/.dotfiles
* Run ~/.dotfiles/etc/setup_env.sh
* On Windows, run `& "$HOME\.dotfiles\windows_configs\windows_setup.ps1"` from PowerShell
  Add `-SkipWinget` to skip WinGet package installation and PowerToys configuration.

Additional Steps
================

* Put your name and email in ~/.gitconfig-custom
```
[user]
    name = Joe Blogs
    email = user@domain.top
```
